[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3278706272","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110400#issuecomment-3278706272","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110400","id":3278706272,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7DbRZg","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-11T07:10:35Z","updated_at":"2025-09-11T07:10:35Z","body":"> Considering that hashes are fine as long as they don't conflict, and given that existing code is working with this, I assume it should be fine.\r\n> \r\n> However, since I'm not an expert of hash algorithm, it might be better to have someone with more detailed knowledge review it.\r\n> \r\n> The literature I found on the internet was as follows: https://stackoverflow.com/questions/20511347/a-good-hash-function-for-a-vector\r\n\r\nAny hash algorithm may have collisions. If a value with the same hash already exists in the container, we should handle hash collisions (comparing if the values are actually equal always, placing elements with the same hash into a bucket when inserting).\r\n\r\nIt seems we are not doing so, using hash directly as a key seems problematic, which may be a separate issue.\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2dd26a027a99633231184616d4dd287bbdd1c0a3/scene/animation/animation_mixer.h#L307","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3278706272/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3278899232","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110400#issuecomment-3278899232","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110400","id":3278899232,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7DcAgg","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-11T07:35:32Z","updated_at":"2025-09-11T07:36:50Z","body":"It's true that it occurs with astronomical probability. If we want to add avoidance, I think adding it is nice. The track hash was originally implemented in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/86687 to identify blendable track counts, so as long as it can identify them, it's fine.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3278899232/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3279016648","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110400#issuecomment-3279016648","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110400","id":3279016648,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7DcdLI","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-11T07:56:47Z","updated_at":"2025-09-11T07:56:47Z","body":"I think we just need to replace `TypeHash` with a struct as key, and implement its hasher and comparator, so we can completely avoid hash collisions.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3279016648/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3279834741","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110400#issuecomment-3279834741","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110400","id":3279834741,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Dfk51","user":{"login":"mrjustaguy","id":50302479,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzAyNDc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50302479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy","html_url":"https://github.com/mrjustaguy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-11T10:37:15Z","updated_at":"2025-09-11T10:37:15Z","body":"Benchmarking would be nice, you can use the MRP of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101494 if you don't have an MRP of your own to share","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3279834741/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3282726316","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110400#issuecomment-3282726316","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110400","id":3282726316,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Dqm2s","user":{"login":"Ryan-000","id":73148864,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTQ4ODY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73148864?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000","html_url":"https://github.com/Ryan-000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-11T21:40:40Z","updated_at":"2025-09-11T21:40:40Z","body":"> I think we just need to replace `TypeHash` with a struct as key, and implement its hasher and comparator, so we can completely avoid hash collisions.\r\n\r\nThis purpose of this PR is to make the current hashing implementation more efficient, not to rewrite the hashing backend. If you’d like to take it on, feel free to open a separate PR.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3282726316/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3282762113","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110400#issuecomment-3282762113","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110400","id":3282762113,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7DqvmB","user":{"login":"Ryan-000","id":73148864,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTQ4ODY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73148864?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000","html_url":"https://github.com/Ryan-000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-11T21:59:56Z","updated_at":"2025-09-11T21:59:56Z","body":"> Benchmarking would be nice, you can use the MRP of #101494 if you don't have an MRP of your own to share\r\n\r\nI reviewed the MRP, but it is not suitable to benchmark this PR, as there are not enough animations or tracks to reveal the impact during the initial load (only 3 animations, with 4 tracks).  \r\n\r\nIf you would like to benchmark this PR, you would need a project with a much more animations/track counts (for reference, my game has 27,723 tracks across 375 skeletal animations).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3282762113/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimiz